    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications (2026-11-21, Ed Bozzard): word rectangles re-projected from the Voynichese
Project's image frames onto the Yale Beinecke IIIF canvases through per-folio homographies;
clipped to the canvas; 336 rectangles removed (see README); a transliteration line number
added; IIIF crop URLs and per-folio quality fields added.

The manuscript images themselves are not included. They are served by Yale University
Library (Beinecke MS 408, https://collections.library.yale.edu/catalog/2002046) under
Yale's own terms.
